  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Distance Learning Programme for Teacher Education: Malakal Diocese.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This is a 2 year teacher education project based on distance teacher training model with satellite training centres in 8 dioceses in Southern Sudan. The main training centre will be based in Malakal diocese. The project will focus in the initial first two year period on construction of training facility, conducting English language course for the pioneer trainee teachers before embarking on full teacher training programme in the third year of inception. The project aims at sustaining adequate production of trained teachers as a means of improving the quality of education in Southern Sudan.</narrative>
  </description>
